        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "None with meagre accumulations is there in that great city and no householder is there without unearned means, and without cows, horses, monies or cereals and who could not sustain his family. [1-6-7]"
      }
    ],
